WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.470
A heavy door swings shut.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.520
On the other side is someone
who has done something terrible.

3
00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.440
Some people say that whatever
happens to them next,

4
00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.410
they brought it on themselves.

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:15.960
Others say that how we treat them
shows what kind of society we are.

6
00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:21.080
So should prisoners be treated well,
even when they have done terrible things?

7
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:25.280
In this mission, you'll find out how
believers think offenders should be treated,

8
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.690
and the teachings behind their views.

9
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.470
Then you'll weigh arguments on both sides
of a hard question about what punishment

10
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.900
may and may not do.

11
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.810
Your mission: find out how believers think
prisoners should be treated, and why.
